id: pm-web-xo0i
title: Detached startup reports started after its child dies
description: "Detached startup exits zero and reports started before the child reaches health; missing database configuration kills the child and status subsequently reports down. Require bounded configurable readiness, redacted last child log lines and pidfile state on nonzero failure, and no stale pidfile."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-20T10:00:13.921Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-21T19:35:06.999Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T19:35:04.272Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T19:35:04.272Z"
author: codex-agent
resolution: "Reverified main ca7e188bc91e (unchanged since audit): [PR #230](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-web/pull/230) (61d77c7) validates database settings at startup, implements bounded detached readiness, pidfile/stop lifecycle and redacted failure diagnostics; 13 startup regressions are committed. Retained evidence: src/database-check.ts, src/db.ts, src/detached-start.ts."
comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-20T10:01:16.427Z",codex-agent,"No exact duplicate found: onv4 covers configuration and odwq covers stop/pidfiles. Reproduce false success using a real built child. Readiness will require child-owned listening confirmation plus healthy HTTP, with a bounded configurable deadline and failure cleanup."
  "2026-10-20T10:10:17.284Z",codex-agent,"Readiness uses child IPC listening confirmation plus healthy HTTP, preventing another listener from satisfying startup. Detached stdout/stderr are retained in a private per-port log file; failure terminates the child, reports its redacted tail and pidfile state, and clears owned stale state. A healthy child remains running after its launcher exits."
  "2026-10-20T10:11:18.046Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: restored only the previous detach spawn/unref/pidfile success block, rebuilt, then node scripts/with-test-db.ts node --test --test-name-pattern=detached test/startup-readiness.test.ts failed all 4 regressions (exit 1): missing database, immediate health/live pidfile, timeout and unrelated listener. Fixed code restored and rebuilt."
  "2026-10-20T10:21:36.992Z",codex-agent,Linked detached regression selection passed 4/4 (exit 0) through pm test --run --progress --only-last with source/schema context. Existing result tracking is disabled. Full npm and Bun release gates remain required before the PR.
  "2026-10-20T10:51:20.370Z",codex-agent,"Real CLI probing exposed a parsed-option mismatch: the host supplies startupTimeout while embedded callers may supply startup-timeout. Both are now accepted. Added a real CLI process test using a plain-directory tracker and the built extension, proving --startup-timeout 1 is honored; it and the unhealthy-child timeout selection pass 2/2. No SDK mocks or registry install are used."
  "2026-10-20T10:53:22.297Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert of only the parsed startupTimeout option lookup makes both the real CLI deadline test and the normalized unhealthy-child deadline test fail (0/2, exit 1). Fixed code restored and rebuilt. This completes the real-parser regression proof in addition to the detach, preflight and doctor reverts."
  "2026-10-20T11:00:53.115Z",codex-agent,"Final parser-aware linked validations pass: complete startup suite 10/10; real CLI deadline selection 1/1; detach/pidfile selection 4/4. Zero failures/cancellations/skips. Existing test-result tracking remains disabled, so receipts are recorded here."
  "2026-10-20T12:21:18.933Z",codex-agent,"Hardened bounded child-log reads to discard an incomplete first line, preventing a retained tail from starting inside a long credential/connection string. A real built-server child bootstrap fixture proves privacy with and without a final newline. Removing only this guard fails the regression 0/1; restored implementation passes 1/1."
  "2026-10-20T12:37:30.092Z",codex-agent,"Native Bun built-wrapper lifecycle acceptance also passes: detached command exit0, immediate real health HTTP200 after launcher exit, and stop exit0. Final gate attempts will use unchanged runtime/test/schema inputs and unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-10-20T13:55:07.862Z",codex-agent,"Final privacy regression verifies actual oversized child-log fixtures with and without a newline. The bounded tail discards an incomplete first line before redaction so a truncated URL cannot leak credentials. Fixed selection passes 1/1; reverting only that guard fails 0/1. Full Bun gate on the preceding revision completed 699 tests: 696 passed, 2 failed, 1 canceled, 0 skipped. Failures were the catalog timeout/cascade and graph latency tracked by pm-web-qdhx and pm-web-hqqp. Coverage 91.84 statements/lines, 81.38 branches, 95.66 functions missed the unchanged 92.07 line floor; all four new startup modules measured 100 statements/lines/functions. Full gates are being rerun on frozen final inputs."
  "2026-10-20T14:49:19.896Z",codex-agent,"Final verification: npm run release:check and bun run release:check both exit 0; 699/699 tests each with zero skipped/canceled/todo, unchanged thresholds and deadlines. All 393 runtime/test/schema/build inputs stayed unchanged. The final linked startup suite passes 13/13. Both earlier catalog and graph timing failures pass in the final full runs. Before/after diagnostics, bounded readiness, redacted log tails, pidfile state and all behavioral revert proofs are documented in docs/startup-readiness.md. Host CLI error labeling and source-install scan cap are reported as UX observations, not filed upstream. Leave this item open and release the claim."
